      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    closing_prices = [150, 152, 155, 151, 154, 156, 157, 158, 160, 162, 161, 159]\n    lookback_period = 5\n    window = closing_prices[-lookback_period:]\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    rank = sorted(window).index(window[-1]) + 1\n    worden_stochastic = (100 / (lookback_period - 1)) * (rank - 1)\n\n    # Return the answer as a percentage rounded to two decimal places\n    return f\"{worden_stochastic:.2f}%\"\n```",
